# Database

## Migrations

- Tool: **golang-migrate**; sequential numbered files; never edit applied migrations — add a new one.
- All timestamps **`TIMESTAMPTZ`**, stored UTC.

## RBAC (foundation — do not simplify)

- `roles`, `permissions` catalog, `user_workspace_roles` composite PK — per SDD §6.2.
- Preset roles protected with `is_preset` / `is_system`; permission checks use `TEXT[]` + GIN as specified.

## Messages & channels

- Thread fields: `reply_to_message_id`, `root_message_id`, `reply_count`.
- Soft vs hard delete rules per SDD §6.4; retention vs trash are **separate** settings (§7.1).

## Queries

- Parameterized only; no string-concat SQL.
- Index for hot paths (workspace_id + channel_id + created_at for message history).

When schema behavior changes, update `docs/architecture/wichat-system-design.md` in the same PR or follow-up immediately.
